{"seq":2,"slug":"dcg-parsing","title":"DCG 与语法解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/dcg-parsing","wordCount":1145,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dcg-与语法解析\">DCG 与语法解析</h1><p>定义子句文法（Definite Clause Grammars, DCG）是 Prolog 将形式语法直接嵌入语言的机制。DCG 规则在编译时自动转化为差异列表操作，使得编写解析器、生成器和字符串变换器如同书写语法规则一样自然。这种能力让 Prolog 在自然语言处理、协议解析和领域特定语言实现中保持独特竞争力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>理解 DCG 需要把握以下概念及其关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>--&gt;</code> 运算符</strong>：DCG 规则的书写形式，编译时被展开为带两个隐藏参数（输入列表、剩余列表）的普通子句；</li>\n<li><strong>终结符与非终结符</strong>：<code>[token]</code> 匹配输入词素，<code>rule_name</code> 递归调用其他 DCG 规则，<code>{ Goal }</code> 嵌入普通 Prolog 目标而不消耗输入；</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏参数即差异列表</strong>：DCG 的编译结果本质是差异列表操作，<code>S0</code> 与 <code>S</code> 的差值就是被该规则消费的序列；</li>\n<li><strong><code>phrase/2,3</code></strong>：调用 DCG 规则的入口，负责提供初始输入列表；</li>\n<li><strong>双向性</strong>：因底层是合一而非模式匹配，同一文法既可用于解析，也可用于生成合法序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DCG 元素</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>消耗输入</th>\n<th>编译结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>终结符</td>\n<td><code>[token]</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>S0 = [token|S]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非终结符</td>\n<td><code>rule_name</code></td>\n<td>视规则</td>\n<td><code>rule_name(S0, S)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prolog 目标</td>\n<td><code>{ Goal }</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>Goal</code>（参数不变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列</td>\n<td><code>a, b</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>a(S0,S1), b(S1,S)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择</td>\n<td><code>a ; b</code></td>\n<td>视分支</td>\n<td><code>a(S0,S) ; b(S0,S)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dcg-的语法与编译\">DCG 的语法与编译</h2><p>DCG 规则用 <code>--&gt;</code> 替代普通子句的 <code>:-</code>。编译器将每个 DCG 规则转化为带两个隐藏参数（输入列表和剩余列表）的普通 Prolog 子句：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% DCG 规则&#10;greeting --&gt; [hello], name.&#10;name --&gt; [world].&#10;name --&gt; [prolog].&#10;&#10;%% 编译后等价于（差异列表形式）&#10;greeting(S0, S) :- S0 = [hello|S1], name(S1, S).&#10;name(S0, S) :- S0 = [world|S].&#10;name(S0, S) :- S0 = [prolog|S].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% DCG 规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>greeting --> [hello], name.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name --> [world].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name --> [prolog].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 编译后等价于（差异列表形式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>greeting(S0, S) :- S0 = [hello|S1], name(S1, S).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name(S0, S) :- S0 = [world|S].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name(S0, S) :- S0 = [prolog|S].</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调用 DCG 规则使用 <code>phrase/2</code> 或 <code>phrase/3</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"?- phrase(greeting, [hello, world]).&#10;true.&#10;&#10;?- phrase(greeting, [hello, prolog]).&#10;true.&#10;&#10;?- phrase(greeting, [hello, X]).&#10;X = world ;&#10;X = prolog.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>?- phrase(greeting, [hello, world]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- phrase(greeting, [hello, prolog]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>true.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- phrase(greeting, [hello, X]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = world ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>X = prolog.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"终结符与非终结符\">终结符与非终结符</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>DCG 语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>终结符</td>\n<td><code>[token]</code></td>\n<td>匹配输入中的具体词素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非终结符</td>\n<td><code>rule_name</code></td>\n<td>调用另一个 DCG 规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prolog 目标</td>\n<td><code>{ Goal }</code></td>\n<td>执行普通 Prolog 代码（不消耗输入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空产生式</td>\n<td><code>[]</code></td>\n<td>匹配空序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推回符</td>\n<td><code>pushback(List, Rest)</code></td>\n<td>将终结符放回输入流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 混合使用终结符、非终结符和 Prolog 目标&#10;digit(D) --&gt; [D], { D &gt;= 0, D =&lt; 9 }.&#10;digits([D|Ds]) --&gt; digit(D), digits(Ds).&#10;digits([D]) --&gt; digit(D).&#10;&#10;number(N) --&gt; digits(Ds), { number_codes(N, Ds) }.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 混合使用终结符、非终结符和 Prolog 目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>digit(D) --> [D], { D >= 0, D =&#x3C; 9 }.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>digits([D|Ds]) --> digit(D), digits(Ds).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>digits([D]) --> digit(D).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>number(N) --> digits(Ds), { number_codes(N, Ds) }.</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构建算术表达式解析器\">构建算术表达式解析器</h2><p>DCG 天然适合构建递归下降解析器。以下是一个支持加减乘除和括号的算术表达式解析器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 表达式文法（处理运算符优先级）&#10;expr(E) --&gt; term(T), expr_rest(T, E).&#10;expr_rest(T, E) --&gt; [+], term(T2), expr_rest(T + T2, E).&#10;expr_rest(T, E) --&gt; [-], term(T2), expr_rest(T - T2, E).&#10;expr_rest(T, T) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;term(T) --&gt; factor(F), term_rest(F, T).&#10;term_rest(F, T) --&gt; [*], factor(F2), term_rest(F * F2, T).&#10;term_rest(F, T) --&gt; [/], factor(F2), term_rest(F / F2, T).&#10;term_rest(F, F) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;factor(N) --&gt; [N], { number(N) }.&#10;factor(E) --&gt; [&#39;(&#39;], expr(E), [&#39;)&#39;].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 表达式文法（处理运算符优先级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr(E) --> term(T), expr_rest(T, E).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr_rest(T, E) --> [+], term(T2), expr_rest(T + T2, E).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr_rest(T, E) --> [-], term(T2), expr_rest(T - T2, E).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr_rest(T, T) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term(T) --> factor(F), term_rest(F, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term_rest(F, T) --> [*], factor(F2), term_rest(F * F2, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term_rest(F, T) --> [/], factor(F2), term_rest(F / F2, T).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>term_rest(F, F) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factor(N) --> [N], { number(N) }.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>factor(E) --> ['('], expr(E), [')'].</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;expr&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;term&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;expr_rest&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;factor&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;term_rest&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;+/-&quot;| F[&quot;term&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;空&quot;| G[&quot;结束&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;*,/&quot;| H[&quot;factor&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;空&quot;| I[&quot;结束&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;数字&quot;| J[&quot;N&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;左括号&quot;| K[&quot;expr&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"expr\"] --&gt; B[\"term\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"expr_rest\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"factor\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"term_rest\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"+/-\"| F[\"term\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"空\"| G[\"结束\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"*,/\"| H[\"factor\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"空\"| I[\"结束\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"数字\"| J[\"N\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"左括号\"| K[\"expr\"]</pre><h2 id=\"dcg-与状态传递\">DCG 与状态传递</h2><p>DCG 的隐藏参数机制可以被泛化为任意状态的线程化传递。通过 SWI-Prolog 的 <code>library(dcg/basics)</code> 和自定义状态，DCG 能处理带上下文的解析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 用额外参数传递解析状态&#10;:- use_module(library(dcg/basics)).&#10;&#10;%% 解析 CSV 行&#10;csv_line(Fields) --&gt; csv_field(F), csv_rest(F, Fields).&#10;csv_rest(F, [F|Fs]) --&gt; [0&#39;,], csv_field(F2), csv_rest(F2, Fs).&#10;csv_rest(F, [F]) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;csv_field(Field) --&gt;&#10;    { atom_codes(Field, Codes) },&#10;    string_without(&quot;,\\n&quot;, Codes).&#10;&#10;%% 解析带行号的输入&#10;:- use_module(library(dcg/high_order)).&#10;&#10;lines_numbered(Lines) --&gt; lines_numbered(1, Lines).&#10;lines_numbered(N, [N-Line|Rest]) --&gt;&#10;    line(Line), { N1 is N + 1 },&#10;    lines_numbered(N1, Rest).&#10;lines_numbered(_, []) --&gt; [].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 用额外参数传递解析状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(dcg/basics)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 解析 CSV 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>csv_line(Fields) --> csv_field(F), csv_rest(F, Fields).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>csv_rest(F, [F|Fs]) --> [0',], csv_field(F2), csv_rest(F2, Fs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>csv_rest(F, [F]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>csv_field(Field) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { atom_codes(Field, Codes) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    string_without(\",\\n\", Codes).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 解析带行号的输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(dcg/high_order)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lines_numbered(Lines) --> lines_numbered(1, Lines).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lines_numbered(N, [N-Line|Rest]) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    line(Line), { N1 is N + 1 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lines_numbered(N1, Rest).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lines_numbered(_, []) --> [].</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"半上下文规则-pushback-notation\">半上下文规则（Pushback Notation）</h2><p>半上下文规则允许 DCG 规则在匹配后将某些终结符「放回」输入流，实现前瞻（lookahead）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 利用半上下文实现前瞻&#10;sentence(S) --&gt; noun_phrase(NP), verb_phrase(VP),&#10;    { S = s(NP, VP) }.&#10;&#10;%% SWI-Prolog 的 pushback 语法&#10;eos([], []).  % 检测输入末尾而不消耗&#10;&#10;%% 条件终止&#10;items([]) --&gt; call(eos).&#10;items([I|Is]) --&gt; item(I), items(Is).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 利用半上下文实现前瞻</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sentence(S) --> noun_phrase(NP), verb_phrase(VP),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { S = s(NP, VP) }.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% SWI-Prolog 的 pushback 语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>eos([], []).  % 检测输入末尾而不消耗</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 条件终止</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items([]) --> call(eos).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items([I|Is]) --> item(I), items(Is).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生成模式-dcg-的双向性\">生成模式：DCG 的双向性</h2><p>DCG 不仅能解析——由于底层是合一而非模式匹配，同一个文法可以用于<strong>生成</strong>符合语法的序列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 简单英语句子文法&#10;sentence --&gt; noun_phrase, verb_phrase.&#10;noun_phrase --&gt; determiner, noun.&#10;verb_phrase --&gt; verb, noun_phrase.&#10;verb_phrase --&gt; verb.&#10;&#10;determiner --&gt; [the].&#10;determiner --&gt; [a].&#10;noun --&gt; [cat].&#10;noun --&gt; [dog].&#10;noun --&gt; [mouse].&#10;verb --&gt; [chases].&#10;verb --&gt; [sees].&#10;&#10;%% 生成所有合法句子&#10;?- phrase(sentence, S).&#10;S = [the, cat, chases, the, cat] ;&#10;S = [the, cat, chases, the, dog] ;&#10;S = [the, cat, chases, the, mouse] ;&#10;...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 简单英语句子文法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sentence --> noun_phrase, verb_phrase.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun_phrase --> determiner, noun.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb_phrase --> verb, noun_phrase.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb_phrase --> verb.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>determiner --> [the].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>determiner --> [a].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun --> [cat].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun --> [dog].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noun --> [mouse].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb --> [chases].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>verb --> [sees].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 生成所有合法句子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- phrase(sentence, S).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = [the, cat, chases, the, cat] ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = [the, cat, chases, the, dog] ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = [the, cat, chases, the, mouse] ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种双向性使 DCG 同时适用于验证（输入是否合法）、解析（提取结构）和生成（从结构产生序列）三种任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用-json-解析器\">实际应用：JSON 解析器</h2><p>以下是一个使用 DCG 实现的精简 JSON 解析器，展示 DCG 在实际协议解析中的能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(dcg/basics)).&#10;&#10;json_value(V) --&gt; json_object(V).&#10;json_value(V) --&gt; json_array(V).&#10;json_value(V) --&gt; json_string(V).&#10;json_value(V) --&gt; json_number(V).&#10;json_value(true) --&gt; &quot;true&quot;.&#10;json_value(false) --&gt; &quot;false&quot;.&#10;json_value(null) --&gt; &quot;null&quot;.&#10;&#10;json_object(json(Pairs)) --&gt;&#10;    &quot;{&quot;, whites, json_pairs(Pairs), whites, &quot;}&quot;.&#10;json_pairs([K-V|Rest]) --&gt;&#10;    json_string(K), whites, &quot;:&quot;, whites, json_value(V),&#10;    json_pairs_rest(Rest).&#10;json_pairs([]) --&gt; [].&#10;json_pairs_rest([K-V|Rest]) --&gt;&#10;    whites, &quot;,&quot;, whites,&#10;    json_string(K), whites, &quot;:&quot;, whites, json_value(V),&#10;    json_pairs_rest(Rest).&#10;json_pairs_rest([]) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;json_array(Vs) --&gt; &quot;[&quot;, whites, json_values(Vs), whites, &quot;]&quot;.&#10;json_values([V|Rest]) --&gt;&#10;    json_value(V), json_values_rest(Rest).&#10;json_values([]) --&gt; [].&#10;json_values_rest([V|Rest]) --&gt;&#10;    whites, &quot;,&quot;, whites, json_value(V), json_values_rest(Rest).&#10;json_values_rest([]) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;json_string(S) --&gt; &quot;\\&quot;&quot;, string_codes(Cs), &quot;\\&quot;&quot;,&#10;    { atom_codes(S, Cs) }.&#10;string_codes([C|Cs]) --&gt; [C], { C \\= 0&#39;&quot; }, string_codes(Cs).&#10;string_codes([]) --&gt; [].&#10;&#10;json_number(N) --&gt; number(N).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(dcg/basics)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(V) --> json_object(V).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(V) --> json_array(V).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(V) --> json_string(V).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(V) --> json_number(V).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(true) --> \"true\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(false) --> \"false\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_value(null) --> \"null\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_object(json(Pairs)) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"{\", whites, json_pairs(Pairs), whites, \"}\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_pairs([K-V|Rest]) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    json_string(K), whites, \":\", whites, json_value(V),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    json_pairs_rest(Rest).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_pairs([]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_pairs_rest([K-V|Rest]) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    whites, \",\", whites,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    json_string(K), whites, \":\", whites, json_value(V),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    json_pairs_rest(Rest).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_pairs_rest([]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_array(Vs) --> \"[\", whites, json_values(Vs), whites, \"]\".</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_values([V|Rest]) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    json_value(V), json_values_rest(Rest).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_values([]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_values_rest([V|Rest]) --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    whites, \",\", whites, json_value(V), json_values_rest(Rest).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_values_rest([]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_string(S) --> \"\\\"\", string_codes(Cs), \"\\\"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { atom_codes(S, Cs) }.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>string_codes([C|Cs]) --> [C], { C \\= 0'\" }, string_codes(Cs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>string_codes([]) --> [].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>json_number(N) --> number(N).</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dcg-与差异列表的关系\">DCG 与差异列表的关系</h2><p>DCG 的编译结果本质上是<a href=\"list-processing-recursion\">列表处理与递归</a>中介绍的差异列表操作。理解这个对应关系有助于手动优化复杂文法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DCG 概念</th>\n<th>差异列表对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>终结符 <code>[a]</code></td>\n<td><code>S0 = [a|S1]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非终结符 <code>p</code></td>\n<td><code>p(S0, S1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列 <code>a, b</code></td>\n<td><code>a(S0, S1), b(S1, S2)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择 <code>a ; b</code></td>\n<td><code>a(S0, S1) ; b(S0, S1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prolog 目标 <code>{G}</code></td>\n<td><code>G</code>（不消耗列表）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"性能与优化\">性能与优化</h2><p>DCG 解析器的性能取决于文法的结构。左递归文法会导致无限循环（同 Prolog 的左递归问题），需要改写为右递归或使用 <a href=\"../advanced-topics/tabling-memoization\">Tabling 与记忆化</a>实现 Earley/CYK 风格的表格化解析。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 左递归——会无限循环&#10;expr(X+Y) --&gt; expr(X), [+], term(Y).  % 危险！&#10;&#10;%% 改写为右递归（如上文 expr_rest 模式）&#10;expr(E) --&gt; term(T), add_ops(T, E).&#10;add_ops(T, E) --&gt; [+], term(T2), add_ops(T+T2, E).&#10;add_ops(T, T) --&gt; [].\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 左递归——会无限循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr(X+Y) --> expr(X), [+], term(Y).  % 危险！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 改写为右递归（如上文 expr_rest 模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expr(E) --> term(T), add_ops(T, E).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add_ops(T, E) --> [+], term(T2), add_ops(T+T2, E).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>add_ops(T, T) --> [].</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Scryer Prolog 的 DCG 实现将规则编译为高效的状态转换系统，对于 UTF-8 字符列表操作有特别优化——利用紧凑内部表示实现比传统链表快数倍的字符串匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DCG 把文法规则提升为语言的一等公民，本文要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>--&gt;</code> 在编译期展开为差异列表子句，文法即是可执行的解析器；</li>\n<li>终结符、非终结符与 <code>{ Goal }</code> 的组合覆盖了绝大多数语法描述需求；</li>\n<li>借助合一的双向性，同一文法同时胜任验证、解析与生成三类任务；</li>\n<li>手写递归下降需要处理运算符优先级，DCG 用分层非终结符（<code>expr</code>/<code>term</code>/<code>factor</code>）自然解决；</li>\n<li>左递归会无限循环，需改写为右递归，或用 <a href=\"../advanced-topics/tabling-memoization\">Tabling 与记忆化</a>实现表格化解析；</li>\n<li>差异列表既是 DCG 的编译目标，也是手工优化复杂文法时的理解工具。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>若要考查 DCG 在知识密集型任务中的应用，可接着阅读<a href=\"../applications/knowledge-representation-ai\">知识表示与 AI 应用</a>中的自然语言处理部分。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DCG 与语法解析","id":"dcg-与语法解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DCG 的语法与编译","id":"dcg-的语法与编译"},{"level":2,"text":"终结符与非终结符","id":"终结符与非终结符"},{"level":2,"text":"构建算术表达式解析器","id":"构建算术表达式解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"DCG 与状态传递","id":"dcg-与状态传递"},{"level":2,"text":"半上下文规则（Pushback Notation）","id":"半上下文规则-pushback-notation"},{"level":2,"text":"生成模式：DCG 的双向性","id":"生成模式-dcg-的双向性"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用：JSON 解析器","id":"实际应用-json-解析器"},{"level":2,"text":"DCG 与差异列表的关系","id":"dcg-与差异列表的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"性能与优化","id":"性能与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"列表处理与递归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/list-processing-recursion"},"next":{"title":"约束逻辑编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming"}}